{"unit_id":"lanbaolu__dsh-fail-soft#card-zh","repo":"lanbaolu/dsh-fail-soft","commit":"cc14ae97b4758affd5befb975e56d1fd6e10ebe1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@lanbaolu/dsh-fail-soft 是面向 DSH Web 与 Desktop 的故障恢复插件。它在插件树挂载失败时识别失败条目，将可隔离的插件写入 profile 补丁并重试挂载；运行期还提供隔离列表、手动隔离、恢复、补丁修复和开关管理。主要功能包括故障插件自动隔离、隔离条目查询与恢复、设置面板开关以及补丁健康修复，适合希望 DSH 遇到插件故障时仍能启动并便于管理恢复的用户。挂载期保护需启用 fail-soft；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/mount.js:54-89","lib/index.js:69-127","lib/index.js:131-161"]}
{"unit_id":"lanbaolu__dsh-fail-soft#card-en","repo":"lanbaolu/dsh-fail-soft","commit":"cc14ae97b4758affd5befb975e56d1fd6e10ebe1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@lanbaolu/dsh-fail-soft helps DSH recover from plugin loading failures. It disables eligible failed plugins and retries mounting. Tools and a settings panel let users inspect, quarantine, restore, and repair. Mount protection must be enabled; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/mount.js:54-89","lib/index.js:69-127","lib/index.js:131-161"]}
